text:
The objectives of this Chapter are to—
    (a) create efficient and effective governing institutions, with clear and separate roles for the petroleum industry;
    (b) establish a framework for the creation of a commercially oriented and profit-driven national petroleum company;
    (c) promote transparency, good governance and accountability in the administration of the petroleum resources of Nigeria;
    (d) foster a business environment conducive for petroleum operations; and
    (e) deepen local content practice in Nigeria oil and gas industry.

